<p>Hiya Caspian2!</p>
<p>I see. Okay. Perhaps the origin of the Motel is a chain of motels, which no longer exist and almost all records of such a chain seem to have vanished, with very few actually capable of remembering them. And that all of the motels were constructed exactly the same way, and made and furnished inside and outside in a way that made them all identical! And what caused them all to disappear from almost all records was the new mysterious owners purchasing the entire chain! Maybe they could be&#8230; dragons? Interdimensional dragons that expanded into different universes for their own version of a chain?</p>
<p>As for the reason why. One theory can be that it's part of an ongoing experiment on the different guests and worlds. Another is that it's a form of entertainment, like a kind of reality show, for them! OH! One of the Staff could even let slip something to that effect, or at least their own theory about it. Yet another theory is that they are doing this in preparation for a multi-dimensional event/crisis that the &quot;dragons&quot; see coming!</p>
<p>(In addition to dragons, I LOVE Rick and Morty and their Interdimensional Cable episodes, as well as the Morty's Mindblowers and the strange train episode!)</p>

