			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4840139">
									

<p>Haha. Any of these reasons would be plausible and interesting to explore. You just need to pick one and weave the backstory into your logs. Like you said as well, all the Staff need to do is hint and let pieces of info slip - you don't have to detail the backstory for it to work.</p>
<p>The dragons tho&#8230;. heh. That sounds a bit random atm. But if you can find a way to include it earlier on in the article, why not? Anyway, here's your <span style="color: green"><strong>greenlight</strong></span>. The concept is ambitious but more importantly, it sounds interesting and worth a read once it's done. Do send me the draft once you get your second greenlight - would love to read it.</p>
<p>Best of luck!</p>

